    "source_message_id": 27,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "With the website now my highest priority, Marissa, here is where each item stands despite how busy I have been:\n\n1\\. Although I may send a few small copy revisions shortly, the top half of the landing page looks great, so please begin with that.\n2\\. Agreed: use the common headers and footers and retain the dark theme.\n3\\. The responsive breakpoint guidance is okay.\n4\\. In the attached Prototype UI, the dashboard is working with an app for agent chat. Because the dashboard has its own specialized build process, my scope at this stage is only styling guidance for the shell container. I am happy to handle that as another milestone.\n\nThe attached documents describe the website build approach I have settled on. Any feedback would be welcome and appreciated.\n\nBest,\nDerek"
  },
